The following actions shall be carried out:   
(I) Introduce measure(s) to improve the collection of granular data on undeclared work;  
(II) Introduce measures to transform undeclared into declared work:   
a) deterrent measure(s) which may include, but are not limited to, strengthening inspections and sanctions, as well as preventive measure(s) to promote declared work which may include, but are not limited to, targeted financial incentives;
